  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1602.44 Vector",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1602.44 “Vector” means a carrier that is capable of transmitting a pathogen from one organism to another, including but not limited to flies and other insects, rodents, birds, and other vermin.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
